---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: AIVANCE — Digitalisierungsagentur Rhein-Main
metaTitle: AIVANCE — Digitalisierungsagentur Rhein-Main
metaDescription: Website, Foto & Video, Software und Automatisierung aus einer Hand. DSGVO-konform, für Praxen, Kanzleien und Gastronomie.
enUrl: /en/
permalink: /
---

<script>
  // Redirects alter Anker-URLs (§ 3): extern verlinkte Anker dürfen nicht ins Leere laufen
  (function () {
    var map = {
      "#features": "/leistungen/",
      "#usecases": "/branchen/",
      "#integrations": "/leistungen/integrationen/",
      "#projects": "/projekte/",
      "#team": "/ueber-uns/",
      "#contact": "/kontakt/"
    };
    var target = map[window.location.hash];
    if (target) window.location.replace(target);
  })();
</script>

<!-- ═══ HERO (§ 6: Agentur-Klammer, Telefon-Animation bleibt) ═══ -->
<section class="hero">
  <canvas id="bg-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="hero-inner">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <h1 class="headline">
      <span>Digitalisierung<br>aus einer Hand.</span>
      <span class="headline-accent">
        <span class="cycling-wrapper" id="cycling-wrapper">
          <span class="cycling-text active">Website.</span>
          <span class="cycling-text">Software.</span>
          <span class="cycling-text">Automatisierung.</span>
          <span class="cycling-text">Ein Partner.</span>
        </span>
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-subtext">
      Website, Bildmaterial, Software und Automatisierung — abgestimmt statt zusammengestückelt. Sie sprechen mit einem Partner statt mit fünf Dienstleistern. Jede Zusage auf dieser Seite führt ihren Beleg mit.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta-row">
      <a href="/kontakt/" class="btn-primary">Kostenloses Erstgespräch</a>
      <a href="/leistungen/" class="btn-ghost">Leistungen ansehen</a>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">3</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Leistungsbereiche</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">4</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Branchen im Fokus</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">1</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Ansprechpartner</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Telefon-Mockup (Bestandsanimation, auf die Marke umgestellt) -->
  <div class="hero-right" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="phone-wrap" style="position:relative;">
      <div class="float-badge float-badge-1" id="hero-badge1">
        <span class="badge-icon">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="badge-text-group">
          <span class="badge-title">Ein Ansprechpartner</span>
          <span class="badge-sub">statt fünf Dienstleistern</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="float-badge float-badge-2" id="hero-badge2">
        <span class="badge-icon">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="badge-text-group">
          <span class="badge-title">Antwort in 24 Stunden</span>
          <span class="badge-sub">werktags, vom Gründer</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="phone">
        <div class="phone-inner">
          <div class="notch"></div>
          <div class="status-bar">
            <span>9:41</span>
            <div class="status-icons">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M1 9l2 2c4.97-4.97 13.03-4.97 18 0l2-2C16.93 2.93 7.08 2.93 1 9zm8 8l3 3 3-3c-1.65-1.66-4.34-1.66-6 0zm-4-4l2 2c2.76-2.76 7.24-2.76 10 0l2-2C15.14 9.14 8.87 9.14 5 13z"/></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M15.67 4H14V2h-4v2H8.33C7.6 4 7 4.6 7 5.33v15.33C7 21.4 7.6 22 8.33 22h7.33c.74 0 1.34-.6 1.34-1.33V5.33C17 4.6 16.4 4 15.67 4z"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-header">
            <svg class="chat-avatar" viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true">
              <text x="2" y="23" font-family="Instrument Sans, sans-serif" font-weight="600" font-size="22" letter-spacing="-1.2" fill="#161614">a</text>
              <text class="signet-mark" x="17.4" y="12" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="500" font-size="10" fill="#9C4B00">1</text>
              <path d="M2 26.4h20.5" stroke="#C2C2BA" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
